      "description": "The pre-existing closest-side and farthest-side keywords must keep working: this is an addition, not a replacement.",
      "kind": "script",
      "test": "CSS.supports('clip-path', 'circle(closest-side at 30% 40%)') && CSS.supports('clip-path', 'circle(farthest-side at 30% 40%)')",
      "specSection": "https://drafts.csswg.org/css-shapes-1/#funcdef-basic-shape-circle"
    },
    {
      "id": "corner-keywords-work-in-shape-outside",
